Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.56,0:00:17.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&HBF71B8&\2c&H3DB8FB&\3c&H00FFFF&\4c&H7473F9&\fs40\pos(183.2,285.867)}Ghost Meets Gal!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.52,0:00:20.96,Default,,0,0,0,,New students!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.56,0:00:25.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(700,0)\c&H16151B&\\3c&HC896B3&\4c&H7473F9&\2c&HD6680A&\fs17\pos(305.6,174.933)}Loronerol\NA Voice in Bloom
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.78,0:00:25.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm Loronerol, your special\Nlyric-writing instructor.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.48,0:00:26.48,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Loro!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.54,0:00:27.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Loro!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.02,0:00:28.98,Default,,0,0,0,,That's me!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.06,0:00:31.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, let's get started.\NToday's theme is friendship.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.46,0:00:35.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Try to put your feelings into your lyrics!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.08,0:00:41.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Lubna-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.84,0:00:42.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Eep!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.56,0:00:44.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Hehe, these lyrics...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.42,0:00:45.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.48,0:00:48.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Such delicate wording,\Nyet so much conviction!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.90,0:00:49.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.72,0:00:50.84,Default,,0,0,0,,You might be a genius.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.94,0:00:53.58,Default,,0,0,0,,R-Right! I'm good at this. \NYep!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.64,0:00:55.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Hehehehe...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.84,0:00:58.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh right! There was also something\Nimportant to share today.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.16,0:01:00.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Senpai!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.94,0:01:04.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Greetings, new students.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.10,0:01:07.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(700,0)\c&H16151B&\\3c&HC896B3&\4c&H7473F9&\2c&HD6680A&\fs18\\pos(75.2,210.133)}Kairi\NAstesice
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.10,0:01:07.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm Kairi, \Nleader of Astesice.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.38,0:01:10.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, it's the legendary idol, \NLady Kairi!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.46,0:01:12.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to breathe in the same air\Nas much as I can while she's here!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.42,0:01:16.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd like to talk about the\Nnew students' joint live show.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.82,0:01:22.41,Default,,0,0,0,,The joint live show is your first chance\Nto perform as Lyrical Monasterio idols.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.36,0:01:25.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course, participation is optional.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.88,0:01:28.72,Default,,0,0,0,,But it will be a valuable experience,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.00,0:01:33.32,Default,,0,0,0,,and catching the eye of a promoter or\Nsenior idol could open doors for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.66,0:01:35.16,Default,,0,0,0,,The show is in one month.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.26,0:01:38.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You can perform solo or as\Na unit, whichever you prefer.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.76,0:01:40.06,Default,,0,0,0,,A unit...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.40,0:01:43.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to form one...\NWith Santhi!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.56,0:01:51.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&HBF71B8&\2c&H3DB8FB&\3c&H00FFFF&\4c&H7473F9&\fs23}Looking down, sighing, \Nhiding my true feelings
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.50,0:01:53.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&HBF71B8&\2c&H3DB8FB&\3c&H00FFFF&\4c&H7473F9&\fs23}Every time i step forward, \Neven if i'm trembling,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.86,0:01:56.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&HBF71B8&\2c&H3DB8FB&\3c&H00FFFF&\4c&H7473F9&\fs23}I can't lie to my desire of change!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.70,0:01:59.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&HBF71B8&\2c&H3DB8FB&\3c&H00FFFF&\4c&H7473F9&\fs23\pos(188.8,286.933)}It's surely a distant dream right now,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.55,0:02:01.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&HBF71B8&\2c&H3DB8FB&\3c&H00FFFF&\4c&H7473F9&\fs23\pos(202.4,286.933)}but i want to chase it together!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.33,0:02:05.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&HBF71B8&\2c&H3DB8FB&\3c&H00FFFF&\4c&H7473F9&\fs23}Even if our futures are different colors,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.45,0:02:08.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&HBF71B8&\2c&H3DB8FB&\3c&H00FFFF&\4c&H7473F9&\fs23}Let's paint them with the same dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.54,0:02:12.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&HBF71B8&\2c&H3DB8FB&\3c&H00FFFF&\4c&H7473F9&\fs18\pos(189.6,286.933)}Because you are the one \Nwho gives me courage!
